#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:1
msgid "安装指南"
msgstr "Installation Guide"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:3
msgid ""
"**Triton-Ascend**是适配华为Ascend处理器的Triton优化版本，提供核函数自动调优、算子编译及部署能力。支持Atlas "
"A2系列产品、Atlas A3系列产品、Ascend "
"950PR&950DT系列产品，兼容Triton核心语法，并针对昇腾NPU特性进行了深度优化，包括自动解析核函数参数、优化内存访问逻辑、完善安全部署机制等。"
msgstr ""
"**Triton-Ascend** is an optimized version of Triton adapted for Huawei "
"Ascend processors. It provides kernel autotuning, operator compilation, and "
"deployment capabilities. It supports Atlas A2 series products, Atlas A3 "
"series products, and Ascend 950PR&950DT series products. While remaining "
"compatible with core Triton syntax, it is deeply optimized for Ascend NPU "
"features, including automatically parsing kernel parameters, optimizing "
"memory access logic, and improving secure deployment mechanisms."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:5
msgid ""
"本指南指导开发者在**Ubuntu**环境下安装**Triton-"
"Ascend**，涵盖快速安装、源码安装及镜像安装三种方式，并包含环境验证与常见问题排查。"
msgstr ""
"This guide instructs developers on installing **Triton-Ascend** in an "
"**Ubuntu** environment. It covers quick installation, source code "
"installation, and image installation, along with environment verification "
"and troubleshooting."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:7
msgid "环境准备"
msgstr "Environment Preparation"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:9
msgid "**硬件要求**"
msgstr "**Hardware Requirements**"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:11
msgid "Ascend产品：支持Atlas A2系列产品、Atlas A3系列产品、Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品。"
msgstr ""
"Ascend products: Supports Atlas A2 series products, Atlas A3 series "
"products, and Ascend 950PR&950DT series products."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:13
msgid "NPU配置：建议单卡32GB及以上内存。"
msgstr ""
"NPU configuration: We recommend a single device with 32 GB or more memory."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:15
msgid ""
"操作系统：需Linux系统，具体请参考[兼容性查询助手](https://www.hiascend.com/hardware/compatibility)。"
msgstr ""
"Operating system: Requires a Linux system. For details, refer to the "
"[Compatibility Query "
"Assistant](https://www.hiascend.com/hardware/compatibility)."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:17
msgid "**软件依赖**"
msgstr "**Software Dependencies**"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:19
msgid ""
"确定CANN、Python和TorchNPU软件版本并安装。如需具体安装步骤，请参考昇腾社区官网《[CANN快速安装](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download)》完成驱动与固件安装。"
msgstr ""
"Determine the CANN, Python, and TorchNPU software versions to install. For "
"specific installation steps, refer to the [CANN Quick "
"Installation](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download) guide on the Ascend "
"community website to complete driver and firmware installation."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:21
msgid "CANN版本：9.1.0"
msgstr "CANN version: 9.1.0"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:22
msgid "Python版本：3.11"
msgstr "Python version: 3.11"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:23
msgid "TorchNPU版本：2.7.1.post8"
msgstr "TorchNPU version: 2.7.1.post8"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:25
msgid "注：更多配套关系请参考[版本说明表](./release_note.md#version-compatibility-matrix)。"
msgstr ""
"Note: For more version compatibility details, see the [Version Compatibility"
" Matrix](./release_note.md#version-compatibility-matrix)."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:27
msgid "快速安装"
msgstr "Quick Installation"

