#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:35
msgid "源码安装"
msgstr "Source Code Installation"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:37
msgid "安装依赖"
msgstr "Installation Dependencies"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:39
msgid ""
"apt update\n"
"apt install zlib1g-dev clang-15 lld-15\n"
"apt install ccache # optional\n"
"update-alternatives --install /usr/bin/clang clang /usr/bin/clang-15 100\n"
"update-alternatives --install /usr/bin/clang++ clang++ /usr/bin/clang++-15 100\n"
"pip install ninja cmake wheel pybind11 # build-time dependencies"
msgstr ""
"apt update\n"
"apt install zlib1g-dev clang-15 lld-15\n"
"apt install ccache # optional\n"
"update-alternatives --install /usr/bin/clang clang /usr/bin/clang-15 100\n"
"update-alternatives --install /usr/bin/clang++ clang++ /usr/bin/clang++-15 100\n"
"pip install ninja cmake wheel pybind11 # build-time dependencies"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:48
msgid "编译Triton-Ascend"
msgstr "Compiling Triton-Ascend"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:50
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend.git\n"
"cd triton-ascend\n"
"git checkout main\n"
"pip install -e ."
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend.git\n"
"cd triton-ascend\n"
"git checkout main\n"
"pip install -e ."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:57
msgid "自定义LLVM构建（可选）"
msgstr "Custom LLVM Build (Optional)"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:59
msgid "如需自定义构建LLVM，可执行以下步骤编译Triton-Ascend。"
msgstr ""
"If you need to build a custom LLVM, follow these steps to compile Triton-"
"Ascend."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:61
msgid "**代码准备**：通过`git checkout`检出指定版本的LLVM源码并应用补丁。"
msgstr ""
"**Code Preparation**: Use `git checkout` to check out the specified version "
"of the LLVM source code and apply the patch."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:63
msgid ""
"git clone --no-checkout https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project.git\n"
"cd llvm-project\n"
"git checkout f6ded0be897e2878612dd903f7e8bb85448269e5\n"
"wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend/main/third_party/ascend/patch/llvm_patch_f6ded0b.patch\n"
"git apply llvm_patch_f6ded0b.patch"
msgstr ""
"git clone --no-checkout https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project.git\n"
"cd llvm-project\n"
"git checkout f6ded0be897e2878612dd903f7e8bb85448269e5\n"
"wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend/main/third_party/ascend/patch/llvm_patch_f6ded0b.patch\n"
"git apply llvm_patch_f6ded0b.patch"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:71
msgid ""
"**构建LLVM**：路径`/path/llvm-"
"install`为用户规划的LLVM安装路径，需根据实际调整；路径`{PATH_TO}`为第一步中检出LLVM源码的路径。"
msgstr ""
"**Building LLVM**: The path `/path/llvm-install` is the LLVM installation "
"path you planned. Adjust it based on actual conditions. The path `{PATH_TO}`"
" is the path where you checked out the LLVM source code in the first step."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:73
msgid ""
"export LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX=/path/llvm-install\n"
"cd {PATH_TO}/llvm-project\n"
"mkdir build\n"
"cd build\n"
"cmake ../llvm \\\n"
"    -G Ninja \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=/usr/bin/clang-15 \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=/usr/bin/clang++-15 \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_LINKER=/usr/bin/lld-15 \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \\\n"
"    -DLLVM_ENABLE_ASSERTIONS=ON \\\n"
"    -DLLVM_ENABLE_PROJECTS=\"mlir;llvm;lld\" \\\n"
"    -DLLVM_TARGETS_TO_BUILD=\"host;NVPTX;AMDGPU\" \\\n"
"    -DLLVM_ENABLE_LLD=ON \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX}\n"
"ninja install\n"
"\n"
"cp  {PATH_TO}/llvm-project/build/bin/FileCheck ${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX}/bin/FileCheck"
msgstr ""
"export LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX=/path/llvm-install\n"
"cd {PATH_TO}/llvm-project\n"
"mkdir build\n"
"cd build\n"
"cmake ../llvm \\\n"
"    -G Ninja \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_C_COMPILER=/usr/bin/clang-15 \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=/usr/bin/clang++-15 \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_LINKER=/usr/bin/lld-15 \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release \\\n"
"    -DLLVM_ENABLE_ASSERTIONS=ON \\\n"
"    -DLLVM_ENABLE_PROJECTS=\"mlir;llvm;lld\" \\\n"
"    -DLLVM_TARGETS_TO_BUILD=\"host;NVPTX;AMDGPU\" \\\n"
"    -DLLVM_ENABLE_LLD=ON \\\n"
"    -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX}\n"
"ninja install\n"
"\n"
"cp  {PATH_TO}/llvm-project/build/bin/FileCheck ${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX}/bin/FileCheck"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:94
msgid ""
"**编译Triton-Ascend**：通过配置LLVM路径定位依赖库，启用ccache加速编译，并关闭Proton和单元测试来减少构建开销。"
msgstr ""
"**Compiling Triton-Ascend**: Configure the LLVM path to locate dependency "
"libraries, enable ccache to accelerate compilation, and disable Proton and "
"unit tests to reduce build overhead."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:96
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend.git\n"
"cd triton-ascend\n"
"LLVM_SYSPATH=${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX} \\\n"
"TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CCACHE=true \\\n"
"TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CLANG_LLD=true \\\n"
"TRITON_BUILD_PROTON=OFF \\\n"
"TRITON_WHEEL_NAME=\"triton_ascend\" \\\n"
"TRITON_APPEND_CMAKE_ARGS=\"-DTRITON_BUILD_UT=OFF\" \\\n"
"python3 setup.py install"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/triton-lang/triton-ascend.git\n"
"cd triton-ascend\n"
"LLVM_SYSPATH=${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX} \\\n"
"TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CCACHE=true \\\n"
"TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CLANG_LLD=true \\\n"
"TRITON_BUILD_PROTON=OFF \\\n"
"TRITON_WHEEL_NAME=\"triton_ascend\" \\\n"
"TRITON_APPEND_CMAKE_ARGS=\"-DTRITON_BUILD_UT=OFF\" \\\n"
"python3 setup.py install"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:108
msgid "**表1**源码编译参数说明表"
msgstr "**Table 1** Source Code Compilation Parameters"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "参数（环境变量）"
msgstr "Parameters (environment variables)"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "默认值"
msgstr "Default value"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "说明"
msgstr "Description"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`LLVM_SYSPATH`"
msgstr "`LLVM_SYSPATH`"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "None"
msgstr "None"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid ""
"指定本地已编译好的 LLVM 安装路径。设置后不再下载 LLVM 预编译包，离线构建时必填，即上文构建 LLVM 步骤中的 "
"`${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX}`。"
msgstr ""
"Specify the installation path of the locally compiled LLVM. After you set "
"this, the precompiled LLVM package is not downloaded. This parameter is "
"required for offline builds, which is the `${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX}` in the "
"preceding LLVM build steps."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CLANG_LLD`"
msgstr "`TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CLANG_LLD`"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "true"
msgstr "true"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "使用 clang/clang++ 作为编译器、lld 作为链接器，需提前安装 clang>=15、lld>=15。"
msgstr ""
"To use clang/clang++ as the compiler and lld as the linker, install "
"clang>=15 and lld>=15 in advance."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CCACHE`"
msgstr "`TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CCACHE`"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "启用 ccache 缓存编译结果，加速重复构建，需提前安装 ccache。"
msgstr ""
"Enable ccache to cache compilation results and speed up repeated builds. "
"Install ccache in advance."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_PROTON`"
msgstr "`TRITON_BUILD_PROTON`"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "OFF"
msgstr "OFF"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "是否构建 Proton 性能分析器（profiler）。需要时设为 `ON`。"
msgstr "Whether to build the Proton profiler. Set it to `ON` if needed."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_TD`"
msgstr "`TRITON_BUILD_TD`"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "是否构建 TD（Triton-distributed-ascend）相关组件，默认关闭。"
msgstr ""
"This option determines whether to build components related to TD (Triton-"
"distributed-ascend). It is disabled by default."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_NPUIR`"
msgstr "`TRITON_BUILD_NPUIR`"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid ""
"是否在安装过程中同步编译 AscendNPU-IR。设为 `ON` 时会触发 `build_npuir.py` 流程；AscendNPU-"
"IR编译依赖CANN，需source /usr/local/Ascend/ascend-"
"toolkit/set_env.sh（以root用户默认安装路径为例）且可用磁盘大于30GB。"
msgstr ""
"Whether to synchronously compile AscendNPU-IR during the installation. When "
"set to `ON`, it triggers the `build_npuir.py` process. AscendNPU-IR "
"compilation depends on CANN. You need to source /usr/local/Ascend/ascend-"
"toolkit/set_env.sh (using the root user default installation path as an "
"example) and ensure that the available disk space is greater than 30 GB."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`TRITON_WHEEL_NAME`"
msgstr "`TRITON_WHEEL_NAME`"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "triton_ascend"
msgstr "triton_ascend"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "生成的 wheel 包名称，一般无需修改。"
msgstr "You generally do not need to modify the generated wheel package name."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`TRITON_APPEND_CMAKE_ARGS`"
msgstr "`TRITON_APPEND_CMAKE_ARGS`"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "追加透传给 CMake 的参数，多个参数用空格分隔。例如追加 `-DTRITON_BUILD_UT=OFF` 可关闭单元测试构建。"
msgstr ""
"Appends parameters passed through to CMake. Separate multiple parameters "
"with spaces. For example, appending `-DTRITON_BUILD_UT=OFF` disables unit "
"test building."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`TRITON_OFFLINE_BUILD`"
msgstr "`TRITON_OFFLINE_BUILD`"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "设为 `ON` 后禁止构建过程中访问网络下载依赖（会自动关闭需联网拉取 googletest 的单元测试构建），用于离线环境。"
msgstr ""
"When set to `ON`, this option prohibits network access during the build "
"process to download dependencies (automatically disabling unit test builds "
"that require network access to pull googletest). It is used for offline "
"environments."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`MAX_JOBS`"
msgstr "`MAX_JOBS`"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "2 × CPU core"
msgstr "2 × CPU core"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "编译并行任务数。内存紧张时可调小，例如 `export MAX_JOBS=8`。"
msgstr ""
"The number of parallel compilation tasks. You can reduce this value when "
"memory is tight, for example, `export MAX_JOBS=8`."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`TRITON_PARALLEL_LINK_JOBS`"
msgstr "`TRITON_PARALLEL_LINK_JOBS`"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "并行链接任务数。链接阶段占用内存较大，内存不足时可设为 `1`。"
msgstr ""
"Number of parallel linking tasks. The linking phase consumes a large amount "
"of memory. If memory is insufficient, you can set it to `1`."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "`IS_MANYLINUX`"
msgstr "`IS_MANYLINUX`"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:0
msgid "设为 `ON` 后构建生成的 wheel 包为 manylinux 兼容格式，用于在不同 Linux 发行版上安装。"
msgstr ""
"When set to `ON`, the built wheel package is in manylinux-compatible format "
"for installation on different Linux distributions."

