#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:198
msgid "运行单元测试（可选）"
msgstr "Running Unit Tests (Optional)"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:200
msgid "源码仓中提供了单op测试用例，位于`third_party/ascend/unittest/pytest_ut`目录下。"
