#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:231
msgid "安装常见问题"
msgstr "# Installation FAQ"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:233
msgid ""
"**问题一：安装TorchNPU时出现报错“ERROR: No matching distribution found for "
"torch==2.7.1+cpu”**"
msgstr ""
"**Issue 1: Error \"ERROR: No matching distribution found for "
"torch==2.7.1+cpu\" occurs when installing TorchNPU**"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:235 ../../zh/installation_guide.md:245
#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:262
msgid "**解决措施**"
msgstr "**Resolution**"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:237
msgid "可以尝试手动安装torch后再安装TorchNPU："
msgstr ""
"You can try manually installing torch first, and then install TorchNPU."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:239
msgid ""
"pip install torch==2.7.1+cpu --index-url "
"https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu"
msgstr ""
"pip install torch==2.7.1+cpu --index-url "
"https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:243
msgid ""
"**问题二：编译安装Triton-Ascend时，如果GCC < 9.4.0，可能报错“ld.lld: error: unable to find "
"library -lstdc++fs”**"
msgstr ""
"**Problem 2: When you compile and install Triton-Ascend, if GCC < 9.4.0, you"
" may encounter the error \"ld.lld: error: unable to find library "
"-lstdc++fs\"**"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:247
msgid ""
"一般是链接器无法找到stdc++fs库引起的报错。该库用于支持GCC "
"9之前版本的文件系统特性。此时需要手动把CMake文件中以下相关代码片段的注释打开。 文件路径：triton-ascend/CMakeLists.txt"
msgstr ""
"This error is usually caused by the linker being unable to find the stdc++fs"
" library. This library is used to support the filesystem features of GCC "
"versions prior to 9. In this case, you need to manually uncomment the "
"relevant code snippet in the CMake file. File path: triton-"
"ascend/CMakeLists.txt"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:250
msgid ""
"if (NOT WIN32 AND NOT APPLE)\n"
"link_libraries(stdc++fs)\n"
"endif()"
msgstr ""
"if (NOT WIN32 AND NOT APPLE)\n"
"link_libraries(stdc++fs)\n"
"endif()"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:256
msgid ""
"**问题三：执行算子时报错“ModuleNotFoundError: No module named "
"'triton._C.libtriton.ascend'; 'triton._C.libtriton' is not a package”**"
msgstr ""
"**Issue 3: The error \"ModuleNotFoundError: No module named "
"'triton._C.libtriton.ascend'; 'triton._C.libtriton' is not a package\" "
"occurs when running an operator**"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:258
msgid "**根因分析**"
msgstr "**Root Cause Analysis**"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:260
msgid "triton-ascend目录被triton覆盖，导致triton-ascend功能受损。"
msgstr ""
"The triton-ascend directory is overwritten by triton, which compromises the "
"functionality of triton-ascend."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:264
msgid "卸载已损坏的triton-ascend，重新安装即可。以3.2.1版本为例，可执行如下命令修复："
msgstr ""
"Uninstall the corrupted triton-ascend and reinstall it. For example, to fix "
"version 3.2.1, run the following commands:"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:266
msgid ""
"pip uninstall triton-ascend triton\n"
"pip install triton-ascend==3.2.1 --extra-index-url=https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/ascend/repos/pypi"
msgstr ""
"pip uninstall triton-ascend triton\n"
"pip install triton-ascend==3.2.1 --extra-index-url=https://mirrors.huaweicloud.com/ascend/repos/pypi"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:271
msgid "**问题四：Triton-Ascend 3.2.1版本为何新增依赖triton？**"
msgstr ""
"**Question 4: Why does Triton-Ascend 3.2.1 add a dependency on Triton?**"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:273
msgid ""
"答复：Triton-Ascend是基于Triton进行的二次开发，与Triton安装目录同名。若用户安装Triton-"
"Ascend之后，再次安装Triton或依赖Triton的三方件，会覆盖Triton目录，导致Triton-Ascend功能受损。 "
"因此通过增加Triton依赖，当Triton被覆盖安装时会有如下提醒。"
msgstr ""
"Answer: Triton-Ascend is a secondary development based on Triton and shares "
"the same installation directory name as Triton. If users install Triton or "
"third-party components that depend on Triton after installing Triton-Ascend,"
" the Triton directory will be overwritten, compromising Triton-Ascend "
"functionality. Therefore, by adding a Triton dependency, the following "
"reminder will appear when Triton is overwritten during installation."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:276
msgid ""
"ERROR: pip's dependency resolver does not currently take into account all the packages that are installed. This behaviour is the source of the following dependency conflicts.\n"
"triton-ascend 3.2.1 requires triton==3.5.0, but you have triton 3.5.1 which is incompatible."
msgstr ""
"ERROR: pip's dependency resolver does not currently take into account all the packages that are installed. This behaviour is the source of the following dependency conflicts.\n"
"triton-ascend 3.2.1 requires triton==3.5.0, but you have triton 3.5.1 which is incompatible."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:281
msgid "若用户遇到且想恢复Triton-Ascend功能，可根据问题三的解决措施进行命令修复。"
msgstr ""
"If you encounter the issue and want to restore Triton-Ascend functionality, "
"run the repair commands based on the solution in Issue 3."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:283
msgid "**问题五：Triton-Ascend 3.2.1版本依赖的Triton版本为何不一致？**"
msgstr ""
"**Issue 5: Why are the Triton versions inconsistent across Triton-Ascend "
"3.2.1 dependencies?**"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:285
msgid ""
"答复：x86与Arm使用不同版本的社区Triton安装包，是因为社区从Triton 3.2版本开始提供x86安装包，而Arm安装包是从Triton "
"3.5版本开始提供的。"
msgstr ""
"Answer: x86 and Arm use different versions of the community Triton "
"installation package because the community began providing the x86 "
"installation package in Triton version 3.2, while the Arm installation "
"package became available in Triton version 3.5."

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:287
msgid "**问题六：如何确认芯片类型？**"
msgstr "**Question 6: How do I confirm the chip type?**"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:289
msgid ""
"可以使用npu-smi命令查看系统上的NPU型号。例如，在npu-smi info命令的输出中，“910B4”对应芯片类型Atlas A2系列产品："
msgstr ""
"You can use the npu-smi command to view the NPU model on the system. For "
"example, in the output of the npu-smi info command, \"910B4\" corresponds to"
" chip type Atlas A2 series products:"

#: ../../zh/installation_guide.md:291
msgid ""
"root@localhost:/# npu-smi  info\n"
"+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n"
"| npu-smi 26.0.rc1                            Version: 26.0.rc1                                                    |\n"
"+---------------------------+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------+\n"
"| NPU   Name                | Health        | Power(W)             Temp(C)                 Hugepages-Usage(page)   |\n"
